# mod-custom-spells: the Druid (Feral tank) concept spell built 2026-10-08 (the
# operator: "ja neue spells im anschluss bauen"; share-public
# custom-spells/08-rework-20261008.md). Test ground as cs_druid: map 13, the FL
# dummy arena. Spells: Dire Bear Form 9634, Lacerate 48568 (a bleed), Maul 48480
# (rank 10, on the next swing).
name    Custom spells - Druid concept spells
timeout 180s

bot dr druid slot=4

place 13 -279 150 -423.2 0
require dr alive
pick d1 creature:920018 near dr
require d1 exists

log Feral - 901035 Maul deals 50 % more to a bleeding target: 4 Mauls (one per swing, Maul hits on the next swing) before and 4 after Lacerate (48568) on the same dummy
do gm target dr
as gm .unlearn 901035
do dr learn 9634
do dr learn 48480
do dr learn 48568
do dr learn 901035
do dr approach d1
wait 1s
do dr cast 9634
wait 1600ms
# deterministic hits: no crit (64481), no miss (Song of Sylvanas 59756), no dodge or
# parry (NPC Hit Buffs 62627: expertise) - only the weapon roll varies
as gm .aura 64481
as gm .aura 59756
as gm .aura 62627
as gm .modify rage 100
spelllog start
do dr attack d1
do dr cast 48480 on d1
wait 2600ms
do dr cast 48480 on d1
wait 2600ms
do dr cast 48480 on d1
wait 2600ms
do dr cast 48480 on d1
wait 2600ms
do dr stop
spelllog stop
# calibrated 2026-10-08 (runs 449, 454): a Maul ~470-510 without a bleed, ~705-765 with one
expect dr spell 48480 hits == 4
expect dr spell 48480 damage <= 2450
as gm .modify rage 100
do dr cast 48568 on d1 triggered
wait 500ms
expect d1 aura 48568
spelllog start
do dr attack d1
do dr cast 48480 on d1
wait 2600ms
do dr cast 48480 on d1
wait 2600ms
do dr cast 48480 on d1
wait 2600ms
do dr cast 48480 on d1
wait 2600ms
do dr stop
spelllog stop
expect dr spell 48480 hits == 4
expect dr spell 48480 damage >= 2450

cleanup
do dr stop
do gm target dr
as gm .unlearn 901035
as gm .unaura 9634
as gm .unaura 64481
as gm .unaura 59756
as gm .unaura 62627
